 | .checkPropertyAccess(String) |
 +--------------------------------+
 | java.lang.System |
 | .getProperty(String) |
 +--------------------------------+
 | xx.lib.LibClass |
 | .getOptions() |
 +--------------------------------+
 | yy.app.AppClass |
 | .main(String[]) |
 +--------------------------------+
```
