##### Example, bad

 template<class T>
 class Vector {
 public:
 // ...
 virtual int size() const { return sz; } // bad: what good could a derived class do?
 private:
 T* elem; // the elements
 int sz; // number of elements
 };

This kind of "vector" isn't meant to be used as a base class at all.

