Source: Cpp Core Guidelines > <a name="s-concurrency"></a>CP: Concurrency and parallelism > <a name="sscp-con"></a>CP.con: Concurrency > <a name="rconc-detach"></a>CP.24: Think of a `thread` as a global container > Reason > Example

##### Example

