# bugprone-terminating-continue

Detects `do while` loops with a condition always evaluating to false that
have a `continue` statement, as this `continue` terminates the loop
effectively.

```cpp
void f() {
do {
 // some code
 continue; // terminating continue
 // some other code
} while(false);
```

