- b = a;
- take_ownership_fn(b);
+ b = std::move(a);
+ take_ownership_fn(std::move(b));
 }
```

Since `std::move()` is a library function declared in `<utility>` it may be
necessary to add this include. The check will add the include directive when
necessary.

