## Limitations

The check will not emit warnings if `std::lock_guard` is used implicitly via
`template` parameter:

```c++
template <template <typename> typename Lock>
void TemplatedLock() {
 std::mutex M;
 Lock<std::mutex> L(M); // no warning
}

void instantiate() {
 TemplatedLock<std::lock_guard>();
}
```

